{"page": 3, "segments": [{"index": 0, "text": "Goal: Explore entire graph, computing discovery/finish times and\nbuilding depth-first forest. Used as subroutine in many graph\nalgorithms.", "rects": [[92.25, 56.24958038330078, 493.0120849609375, 70.34957885742188], [92.25, 70.35032653808594, 466.5782165527344, 84.31832885742188], [92.25, 84.31907653808594, 161.6219940185547, 98.28707885742188]], "duration": 10.425, "start_time": 0.0, "end_time": 10.425}, {"index": 1, "text": "Input: Graph G = (V, E) (adjacency lists).", "rects": [[92.25, 110.28473663330078, 344.7901306152344, 124.38473510742188]], "duration": 3.925, "start_time": 10.425, "end_time": 14.350000000000001}, {"index": 2, "text": "Output: u.d (discovery time), u.f (finish time) for each vertex; u.\u03c0\n(predecessor in DFS forest).", "rects": [[92.25, 136.38238525390625, 493.2330627441406, 150.48239135742188], [92.25, 150.48313903808594, 264.498046875, 164.45114135742188]], "duration": 8.25, "start_time": 14.350000000000001, "end_time": 22.6}, {"index": 3, "text": "Data structures: Global time counter; each vertex has color (WHITE/\nGRAY/BLACK), timestamps d and f, predecessor \u03c0.", "rects": [[92.25, 176.44879150390625, 521.5367431640625, 190.54879760742188], [92.25, 190.54954528808594, 400.6741027832031, 204.51754760742188]], "duration": 8.55, "start_time": 22.6, "end_time": 31.150000000000002}, {"index": 4, "text": "Steps (DFS):", "rects": [[92.25, 216.51519775390625, 176.40924072265625, 230.61520385742188]], "duration": 1.775, "start_time": 31.150000000000002, "end_time": 32.925000000000004}, {"index": 5, "text": "For each vertex u \u2208 G.V: set u.color = WHITE, u.\u03c0 = NIL\ntime = 0\nFor each vertex u \u2208 G.V:\nIf u.color == WHITE: 5. DFS-VISIT(G, u)", "rects": [[122.25, 242.61595153808594, 468.04217529296875, 256.5839538574219], [122.25, 256.584716796875, 174.71400451660156, 270.5527038574219], [122.25, 270.553466796875, 270.09002685546875, 284.5214538574219], [122.25, 284.522216796875, 370.75799560546875, 298.4902038574219]], "duration": 13.6, "start_time": 32.925000000000004, "end_time": 46.525000000000006}, {"index": 6, "text": "Steps (DFS-VISIT(G, u)):", "rects": [[92.25, 310.48785400390625, 257.34478759765625, 324.5878601074219]], "duration": 2.45, "start_time": 46.525000000000006, "end_time": 48.97500000000001}, {"index": 7, "text": "time = time + 1\nu.d = time\nu.color = GRAY\nFor each vertex v in G.Adj[u]:\nIf v.color == WHITE: 6. v.\u03c0 = u 7. DFS-VISIT(G, v)\ntime = time + 1\nu.f = time\nu.color = BLACK", "rects": [[122.25, 336.588623046875, 219.54603576660156, 350.5566101074219], [122.25, 350.557373046875, 186.30599975585938, 364.5253601074219], [122.25, 364.526123046875, 216.9539794921875, 378.4941101074219], [122.25, 378.494873046875, 301.5179748535156, 392.4628601074219], [122.25, 392.463623046875, 429.00604248046875, 406.4316101074219], [122.25, 406.432373046875, 219.54603576660156, 420.4003601074219], [122.25, 420.401123046875, 183.06600952148438, 434.3691101074219], [122.25, 434.369873046875, 225.82199096679688, 448.3378601074219]], "duration": 21.75, "start_time": 48.97500000000001, "end_time": 70.72500000000001}, {"index": 8, "text": "Key property: u.d < v.d < v.f < u.f iff v is a proper descendant of u\n(Corollary 20.8).", "rects": [[92.25, 460.33551025390625, 502.637451171875, 474.4355163574219], [92.25, 474.436279296875, 192.6659698486328, 488.4042663574219]], "duration": 7.775, "start_time": 70.72500000000001, "end_time": 78.50000000000001}, {"index": 9, "text": "Complexity: \u0398(V + E) time. DFS-VISIT called exactly once per vertex;\ntotal work scanning adjacency lists = \u0398(E).", "rects": [[92.25, 500.40191650390625, 522.5025024414062, 514.5018920898438], [92.25, 514.502685546875, 355.6500244140625, 528.4706420898438]], "duration": 10.025, "start_time": 78.50000000000001, "end_time": 88.52500000000002}, {"index": 10, "text": "Edge Cases: DFS may produce a forest (multiple trees) when graph is\ndisconnected. Timestamps range from 1 to 2|V|.", "rects": [[92.25, 540.4683227539062, 523.9749145507812, 554.5682983398438], [92.25, 554.569091796875, 385.1940612792969, 568.5370483398438]], "duration": 9.25, "start_time": 88.52500000000002, "end_time": 97.77500000000002}, {"index": 11, "text": "Edge classification during DFS (by color of v when (u, v) first\nexplored):", "rects": [[92.25, 580.5347290039062, 483.488525390625, 594.6347045898438], [92.25, 594.635498046875, 154.11001586914062, 608.6034545898438]], "duration": 6.75, "start_time": 97.77500000000002, "end_time": 104.52500000000002}, {"index": 12, "text": "WHITE \u2192 tree edge\nGRAY \u2192 back edge\nBLACK \u2192 forward edge (if u.d < v.d) or cross edge (if u.d > v.d)", "rects": [[122.25, 620.604248046875, 242.39398193359375, 634.5722045898438], [122.25, 634.572998046875, 236.87399291992188, 648.5409545898438], [122.25, 648.541748046875, 509.21405029296875, 662.5097045898438]], "duration": 9.475, "start_time": 104.52500000000002, "end_time": 114.00000000000001}, {"index": 13, "text": "PRINT-PATH", "rects": [[62.25, 679.140625, 132.4642791748047, 690.843017578125]], "duration": 1.45, "start_time": 114.00000000000001, "end_time": 115.45000000000002}, {"index": 14, "text": "Type: Algorithm\nGoal: Print vertices on a shortest path from s to v, assuming BFS has\nalready computed the breadth-first tree.\nSteps: \nIf v == s: print s", "rects": [[92.25, 707.4742431640625, 191.63137817382812, 721.57421875], [92.25, 721.5718994140625, 514.5762329101562, 735.671875], [92.25, 735.6726684570312, 338.2140808105469, 749.640625], [92.25, 749.6383056640625, 137.10023498535156, 763.73828125], [122.25, 763.7390747070312, 223.56600952148438, 777.70703125]], "duration": 13.925, "start_time": 115.45000000000002, "end_time": 129.37500000000003}, {"index": 15, "text": "\u2022", "rects": [[81.357421875, 56.25267028808594, 88.43742370605469, 70.22067260742188], [81.357421875, 110.28782653808594, 88.43742370605469, 124.25582885742188], [81.357421875, 1